# Content and map licences

## Roadbook content

The original roadbook text, configuration, and local build scripts in this
repository are licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International
(CC BY 4.0), unless a source page states otherwise.

https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

## Generated maps

The generated map images contain OpenStreetMap data and the required
attribution. OpenStreetMap data is available under the Open Data Commons Open
Database License (ODbL).

https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright
